# Change the settings a user may change: /set_robot_settings, served by the mode manager.
# The request is the complete new set. Refused, with the reason, when a value is outside the
# limits in RobotSettings; nothing is changed then. Once accepted they are saved, published on
# /robot_settings, and used from then on (see RobotSettings for when each one takes hold).
RobotSettings settings
---
bool success
string message              # the reason when refused; otherwise what was saved
RobotSettings settings      # the settings in force after this call
